- if @mode.blank?
  .header
    %h2 设备管理

  .alert.alert-info
    系统不自动从微信那边刷新设备列表, 如需更新，请手动刷新.
    %br/
    注意: 系统每次最多从微信更新50条记录, 您可以点击刷新按钮刷新某个设备的状态

  - if params[:notice]
    .alert.alert-danger
      = params[:notice]

  .form-group
    = link_to '刷新设备列表', refresh_backend_shop_wechat_account_shake_around_devices_path(@current_shop, @wechat_account), :class=>"btn btn-sm btn-primary"
- if @mode
  .header
    %h2 绑定管理
- if @mode && @page
  %table.table.table-striped.table-bordered
    = render partial: 'th'
    = render partial: 'tr', locals: {page: @page}

- if @mode && @mode == "binded"
  .alert.alert-info
    该页面已经被绑定到以下设备
  .form-group
    = link_to '绑定更多设备', bindable_backend_shop_wechat_account_shake_around_page_path(@current_shop, @wechat_account, @page), :class=>"btn btn-sm btn-primary"
    = link_to "批量解除绑定", unbind_backend_shop_wechat_account_shake_around_page_path(@current_shop, @wechat_account, @page), class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary batch_op_action", confirmtxt: "确认将该页面与这些设备解绑？"

- if @mode && @mode == "bindable"
  .alert.alert-info
    - if @devices.size > 0
      请从下方选择设备， 选择后可以把页面配置到这些设备
    - else
      当前没有可以绑定的设备

  .form-group
    = link_to "批量绑定设备", bind_backend_shop_wechat_account_shake_around_page_path(@current_shop, @wechat_account, @page), class: "btn btn-primary batch_op_action", confirmtxt: "确认将该页面绑定到这些设备？"

- if @mode.blank?
  .form-group
    =search_form_for @q, url: backend_shop_wechat_account_shake_around_devices_path(@current_shop, @wechat_account), html:{class: 'form-inline', role: 'form'}, builder: SimpleForm::FormBuilder do |f|
      = f.input_field :device_id_eq, placeholder: Ddt::ShakeAround::Page.human_attribute_name(:device_id)
      = f.input_field :comment_cont, placeholder: Ddt::ShakeAround::Page.human_attribute_name(:comment)
      = f.submit "搜索", class: 'btn btn-xs btn-success'
%table.table.table-striped.table-bordered
  = render partial: 'ddt/backend/shake_around/devices/th'
  = render partial: 'ddt/backend/shake_around/devices/tr', collection: @devices, as: :device
  = no_record_hint(@devices)

%br
.pull-right= will_paginate @devices , renderer: BootstrapPagination::Rails, bootstrap: 3
%br
